ng straight to your headset.\n\nAre you ready to become the ultimate table tennis champion? Grab your paddle and step up to the challenge!\n\n", "short_description": "Step into the virtual arena with Table Tennis Star, the most immersive and realistic VR table tennis experience! Whether you're a casual player or a seasoned pro, this game offers precise paddle control, lifelike ball physics, and engaging gameplay that will keep you coming back for more.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://blackholeinfiverse.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "BlackHole Infiverse", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://blackholeinfiverse.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1700921480735423"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9939326106103042"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823351_4130223483789789_2540537965627731811_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FTqTggpKOOcQ7kNvwH5Q3Ue&_nc_oc=AdrWi4IYOwrM8u8tM5GTkFn_-kM2hnRROk9wXcSThvhNpP_iRhWZ4j7Z10JTnrL_W7M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBRRa-xWUdmAoW1CtfezMI89x_5BlkYX9AcUxtRpr2MLQ&oe=6A635736"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": fals